With 6 days left until the council election, Mr. Thong Khon instructed the voters in Baray and Tangkork districts to make the election better.
(Kampong Thom): With only six days left, the Capital-Provincial and Municipal-District-Khan Council elections are approaching, Mr. Thong Khon, Chairman of the Baray and Taing Kork District Assistance Team On May 20, 2019, the two districts held a meeting and gave additional guidance to ensure that the by-elections will run smoothly.
