Inauguration of achievements in Wat Choam Khyang, Memot district, Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara: If the country is insecure, nothing can happen
(Tbong Khmum): Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for Preah Vihear district and inauguration of achievements at Wat Chan Sovan Moniream, also known as Wat Choam. Snails are located in Memong commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province, on the afternoon of Friday, May 17th, 2019.
