Maduro has just released a video clip of his first meeting with representatives of the ICG task force, during which the two sides discussed a number of issues, including the impact of US sanctions on Venezuela. According to Maduro, the purpose of the meeting was to inform the ICG communications team about the consequences of Washington's pressure and sanctions on his country.
