(Phnom Penh): Secretary of State for the Ministry of Commerce Sam Sereyroth confirmed that the Royal Government of Cambodia is striving to formulate policies and strategies for trade integration in line with China's One Belt and One Road policy to absorb opportunities. Some resources for the development of the country, starting from the development of trade first.
