The suspect is Chea Cheang, a 30-year-old man living in Chroy Dong Village, Samrong Thom Commune, Kien Svay District, Kandal Province. The victim is Phay Srey Mak, a 25-year-old female resident of Prey Bak village, Prek Tomlab commune, Leuk Dek district, Kandal province.
According to the police, the victim died tragically in the guest room above after the suspect tricked her into going to bed, took the rope and killed her, and escaped on a motorcycle on the evening of May 8, 2019. Located in Neak Leung Commune, Peam Ro District, Prey Veng Province.
