(Phnom Penh): The General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia (ECCC) on May 7, 2019 organized a workshop on reviewing the results of the second phase of the one-stop-shop system at Sunway Hotel. To discuss and discuss the results of the system function test and to discuss the preparation for the launch of the second phase of the national single stand system test.
