(Pursat): Because of jealousy, his wife suspected of having an affair with another man, causing the husband to be merciless, kill his wife with an ax and die in a pool of blood, leaving four children. The incident of brutal violence and a bad example in this society happened at 20:20 on May 6, 2019 in Trapeang Khlay village, Boeung Kantuot commune, Krakor district, Pursat province.
