Over the past 31 years, Cambodia has undergone many changes, gone through civil war and built a great nation. At that time, Japan contributed to peace building in Cambodia and walked with Cambodia until today. Cambodia has developed in all areas, as well as in the areas of politics, infrastructure, demining, education, welfare and so on.
