(Rattanakiri): Senior Minister Ly Thuch, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Deputy Chairman of the Central Working Group for Strengthening Local Government in Rattanakiri Province, on May 4, 2019, inspected and solved the problem of water shortage. To the people in Ta Kok Phnong village, Bor Kham commune and Pak Thom village, Pak Nhay commune, O'Yadao district, Ratanakkiri province.
