According to the story, the perpetrator and the two victims argued in front of the Rock Entertainment Center near the Chbar Ampov police station, where he got out of the car and fired five shots at the victim's car from behind. . After the shooting, the perpetrator drove away and after a while, he drove to the scene and was arrested by Chbar Ampov district police.
