(Phnom Penh): Despite receiving $ 8,000 in civil damages from Duong Nakry, Deputy Director of the Criminal Police Department, who shot and attempted to commit suicide, the two victims and their spouses are still deeply saddened. As for the execution of this sentence, he only punished the forces and did not send the case to court for legal punishment.
The husband and wife, who were involved in the incident, claimed that they accepted the compensation because they did not want to stay away from the perpetrator. However, the authorities must also take legal action against the perpetrator, because if the bullet Flying to himself and his wife may not be alive anymore.
Duong Nakry, Deputy Director of the Criminal Police Department, who fired five shots, attempted to kill two couples near the Chbar Ampov District Police Inspectorate, although the two were not immediately injured. The five bullets caused the woman to lose her three-month-old unborn child due to the shocking sound of gunshots that pierced the windshield of her car.
