On that occasion, Lt. Gen. Seng Thearin sent a message from Lt. Gen. Sam Oun expressing regret for the damage to homes, property from the natural disaster, wind, which no one wants to experience. On that occasion, he would like to call on government officials, the armed forces and philanthropists to join in rescuing people affected by the constant thunderstorms.
