(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, in the morning of May 3, 2019, led a working group to inspect and visit and bring the gifts of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to distribute to the people affected by the rain. The wind blew on the roof of the house and there were minor injuries in Lor Ed village, Sangkat Boeung Kok, Kampong Cham city.
