(Phnom Penh): Ms. An Phalla Chea Pisey, Honorary Vice President of the Cambodian Red Cross Sub-Branch in Russey Keo District, reminded the Sangkat-Village Red Cross officials to help provide reports on the actual situation of vulnerable people at the local level. Measures to find solutions in a timely manner as far as possible in response to the guidance of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross.
