(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Commerce and Chairman of the Trade and Investment Development Committee for Trade and Investment, Mr. Pan Sosak, announced the approval in principle on the 4th draft of the Cambodia Trade Integration Strategy (CTIS) with the 2019-2023 Action Plan. And requested inter-ministerial representatives to participate in joint implementation and monitoring to ensure high efficiency.
