It should be noted that Mr. Le Duc Anh passed away at the age of 99 on Monday night, April 22, 2019 due to an illness, and now in Vietnam is preparing his funeral as a national.
Duc Anh spent most of his life in southern Vietnam, where he took part in the Communist Party of Vietnam war against the United States. He served as President of Vietnam from 1992 to 1997. In 1995, he became the first Vietnamese head of state to step on American soil after the Vietnam War. 50th Anniversary of the United Nations in New York.
(Preah Vihear): The Ministry of Tourism, in collaboration with Swiss Confederation, organized a certificate awarding ceremony for 65 successful trainees who completed the hospitality hospitality training program of the hotel service, followed by the opening ceremony of the hospitality training program of the second generation hotel services. 2 Presided over by Mr. Pak Sokhom, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism.
This hospitality training program was held on the afternoon of May 2, 2019 in order to strengthen the capacity of tourism professionals and improve the quality of tourism services in accordance with the Strategic Plan for Human Resource Development in Tourism 2017-2025.
This training course has professional teachers training both theory and practice using ASEAN Training Box (MRA) to business owners and staff working in 5 areas, including: 1. Luxury service 2. Professionalism in tourism 3. Food and beverage service 4. Homework and 5. Frontline office.
