Pompeo: US ready for military intervention in Venezuela
Washington: US Secretary of State Mike Pompeo says the United States is ready for military intervention to resolve the current crisis and unrest in Venezuela. This was released by Fox News on Wednesday, May 1, 2019.
Pompeo made the remarks in an interview with Fox News on Wednesday. "Military intervention is possible ... and if it is necessary, the United States will do it immediately," he said. But at the same time, Pompeo insists Washington still wants to see a peaceful transition of power in Venezuela.
