The victim, Phoris Storan, male, 34 years old, resided in Sangkat Prek Pra, Khan Chbar Ampov. As for the perpetrator, his name is Duong Nakry, male, 47 years old, and he is an official of the Criminal Department of the Ministry of Interior.
