Mr. Ith Sam Heng stated that the beauty pageant has been established four times under the initiative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in 2015, 2016, 2017 and 2018 with success. And the full support of the public, especially from the children of our workers.
He said that today's happy program starts from the success of the Royal Government in maintaining peace, stability and development, which leads to economic growth of more than 7% per year, which creates job opportunities for our people. More than 99.3% success in the implementation of labor rights, improvement of working conditions, raising the value of work and living standards for the children of workers, as well as fruitful social protection.
Mr. Ith Sam Heng said, "Through this program, we hope that our children will be more loving and proud of the work they are doing to contribute to better socio-economic development."
Through this exam, the Minister encouraged the workers to be proud to really show their ability and talent, not only good work, but also beautiful, knowledge of the law related to the field of labor and Social security and other artistic abilities.
