(Phnom Penh): On the occasion of celebrating the 133rd anniversary of International Labor Day on May 1 in Kandal province, on May 1, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, was hugged and kissed by workers. Their leaders.
