Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "A few weeks ago, some politicians asked the workers to arrest their uncles, and today the workers really caught their uncles, kissing, hugging and taking pictures, so this situation also shows "About the close relationship between workers and the country's leaders, but what goes beyond this is unity among all of us."
