(Kampong Cham): Mr. Kao Thach, Deputy Chairman of the Youth Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) visited Prey Chhor District on May 1, 2019 to participate as a speaker in a dissemination program on the political situation in Cambodia to the youth of the CPP from 15 Commune in Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province.
Regarding the outreach program on the political situation in Cambodia, two topics were discussed: 1: The Royal Government of Cambodia's reform measures and 2: What is the EBA?
Mr. Kao Thach reminded the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, in the efforts to restore the Cambodian economy from scratch to achieve a continuous national economic growth and make Cambodia There is equality with other countries on the international stage.
At the same time, he also mentioned 17 reform measures of the Royal Government to explain to the youth one by one, which was announced through the 18th forum of the Royal Government and the private sector under the chairmanship of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
In addition, Mr. Kao Thach also explained the policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia on the mechanism to improve the agricultural sector and reduce production costs of farmers to inform you more.
Finally, the speaker opened the door to ask questions from young people on some issues such as agriculture, drugs, local security, immigration, border issues, etc., with the coordination and summary of discussions from Mr. Chrun. Therawat, Chairman of Prey Chhor District Youth Working Group.
