(Phnom Penh): Take a short trip to get a new experience for only $ 35 / trip AirAsia would like to recommend 4 flights from Sihanoukville to Bangkok (Don Mueang). One week (Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Sunday) that allows Cambodians to visit the magnificent Bangkok, a city full of rich shopping and delicious food.
New flights from "Sihanoukville to Bangkok" offer a new route to Thailand as well as serve foreign travelers, considering Thailand as the center of travel so they can continue. Flights to Sihanoukville, Cambodia's most popular coastal region.
Addition of the latest flight, AirAsia of Thailand will be able to operate flights between Thailand and Cambodia in three destinations: Bangkok (Don Mueang) to Phnom Penh, Siem Reap and Sihanoukville. The airline also offers flights from Phuket to Siem Reap and from Phuket to Phnom Penh to strengthen ties and boost the economies of the two countries.
"Flights from Sihanoukville to Bangkok" will be operated by Thai AirAsia four times a week, every Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Sunday, offering a special promotion of only $ 35 per flight. . Book tickets from April 22 to May 5, 2019 for flights from July 1 to October 25, 2019.
Representative Mr. Vong Soth: Basic training of trainers is to strengthen the capacity to work more targeted
(Kampot): The opening of the course "Training of trainers on data collection procedures on living conditions and needs of veterans and their families" is to strengthen the capacity of trainers, so that community officials have the duty to coordinate and collect information on living conditions and needs. Veterans and their families have the ability to complete questionnaires and targeted response services for veterans.
This was stated by Mr. Touch Channy, Technical Director General and Representative of Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation on Tuesday, April 30, 2019 in the workshop "Training of trainers on data collection procedures from living conditions and Needs of Veterans and Families ”in Kampot Province.
At the same time, Mr. Touch Channy also instructed all participants to participate in this data collection work to be highly effective as an important input for policy and development programs to help them and be grateful. Veterans who have sacrificed fresh flesh and blood for the cause of our motherland. Ministry of Agriculture sets out four main mechanisms for agricultural development
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on April 30, 2019, confirmed the launch of four important mechanisms to develop the agricultural sector in Cambodia to grow.
Key mechanisms for agricultural development include:
1. Promote the growth of all-crop production by diversifying potential crops and increasing the export of agricultural products by expanding agricultural modernization to increase productivity and high market competitiveness by applying smart farming techniques and adaptation to climate change.
2: Promote the growth of animal production by increasing meat products and commercial breeding, as well as promote the raising of good hybrids and are on the market. 3. Increase the management of fishery resources effectively and sustainably by strengthening the implementation of the law on fisheries, maintaining the stability of natural fishing catching around 600,000 tons per year, increase aquaculture production by 20% per year will Give the fishing community a better standard of living.
4: Continue to manage forest resources and wildlife sustainably, contribute to better maintenance of forest cover and increase community forestry income by 20% per year through agricultural diversification and forest reforestation. And continue to implement the necessary measures to contribute to the sustainability of the ecosystem.
Mr. Veng Sakhon made this statement while presiding over the celebration of the 20th anniversary of Heifer International in Cambodia at the Cambodiana Hotel on Tuesday afternoon, April 30, 2019.
The Minister praised and appreciated the significant event that Heifer Cambodia is celebrating now, especially this event will lead us to increase cooperation to serve and protect the national interest to participate in socio-economic development. Progress responds to the real needs of the people in the current context.
