First, Strengthening Cooperation between Cambodia and Myanmar: Ms. Aung San Suu Kyi met with Cambodia's top leaders to strengthen friendship and cooperation in politics, diplomacy and economics. This has brought the two ASEAN member countries closer together as friends in the same community.
Second, Sam Rainsy and the Opposition will not speak: During the detention of Aung San Suu Kyi, President of the Burmese Opposition, at the homes of Sam Rainsy and Mu Sochua, as well as other opposition parties, she and Has done political business on her reputation and blames and accuses the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as a dictator.
But now those accused by Sam Rainsy and his cronies have painted the dictatorship and are working with Aung San Suu Kyi and the leaders of other countries on behalf of the nation. The whole Khmer. Those who painted and incited hatred like Sam Rainsy, Mu Sochua and other opposition groups only fled the country and became law-abiding after repeated mistakes.
Aung San Suu Kyi's presence in Cambodia shattered Sam Rainsy's dreams and shattered Sam Rainsy's ability to use her image for political gain. All the opposition will say is sigh in despair.
Third, Sam Rainsy is not equal to Aung San Suu Kyi's hair: As the president of the political party, Sam Rainsy Mu Sochua and other opposition party officials tried to cling to Aung San Suu Kyi's caliphate by approaching her and taking photos to show her supporters. Its. But in reality, the value of Sam Rainsy, Mu Sochua and other opposition groups is not equal to Aung San Suu Kyi's hair and can not be compared to her heroism.
Cambodia really needs a strong opposition party that participates in criticism in order to build a strong society, but not as destructive, provocative and subversive criticism as Sam Rainsy and his oppressive opposition parties have been doing. No.
Overall, Aung San Suu Kyi's presence in Cambodia on the official visit completely ended the culture of clinging to the prominent politicians of the opposition, and especially Sam Rainsy, who has always been associated with other prominent politicians and also the end of the dream of power. Of Sam Rainsy as well.
How does Sam Rainsy's eyes and emotions hurt? How will Sam Rainsy's jealousy erupt? How does Sam Rainsy think that Aung San Suu Kyi is a changed person and how will Sam Rainsy mock Aung San Suu Kyi? Because she has been having a good and friendly relationship with Samdech Techo Hun Sen and has made the political, diplomatic and economic relations between Cambodia and Burma stronger and more prosperous?
