Chairman of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Council thanked the benefactors for helping to build the road
(Preah Sihanouk): The provincial administration and Preah Sihanouk Provincial Council congratulated and thanked the philanthropists who participated in supporting the concrete road for the people living in Prey Nob district to use easily.
