Kampong Thom Provincial Commissioner Urges All Forces to Perform Their Duties to Strengthen the Efficiency Assigned
(Kampong Thom): Kampong Thom Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Ouk Kosal warned police forces throughout the province to fulfill their duties as assigned by their leaders to strengthen their work efficiency.
On the occasion of leading the flag-raising police force at Kampong Thom Provincial Police this morning, April 29, 2019, Major General Ouk Kosal instructed all forces to continue their efforts to strengthen the discipline of the National Police Force and strengthen Methods of work, skills, competencies, professional measures by implementing their roles and responsibilities according to the hierarchy of national police officers to achieve better results.
Lt. Gen. Ouk Kosal spoke about the past operations of the force, which is an effort to actively participate in the professional work under each professional work plan, as well as to participate in the mission to maintain security and public order. Ensure good security, especially during the traditional Khmer New Year.
The Commissioner added that recently, everywhere, gatherings of people, such as pagodas, resorts, places of entertainment, popular games throughout Kampong Thom province, ensure the best security and order should be pleasing. Continuing praise and encouragement from leaders at all levels for the active efforts of the forces.
