Over the past six years, under the joint efforts of all parties, the construction of the "Belt and Road" initiative has established the basic structure of connectivity and communication. More than 150 signed a cooperation agreement on joint construction of the "Belt and Road" initiative with China.
According to a recent World Bank study, the "Belt and Road" initiative has a positive impact on global trade and employment opportunities, especially growth. Economies of low-income countries.
The "Belt and Road" initiative is pushing for a shift in global governance to build a solid foundation for achieving common development and prosperity.
As the originator of the "Belt and Road", China has actively expanded the volume of trade in services, the service sector has maintained rapid growth and has become an important market for the export of countries along the way.
According to statistics from the Chinese Ministry of Commerce, by the end of 2018, the China-built Overseas Trade Economic Cooperation Zone along the "Belt and Road" built by China will pay a total of 2,400 local taxes. Millions of dollars have created 270,000 jobs.
The One Belt and One Road Entrepreneurship Conference opened for the first time at the Summit, which reached more than 644 billion US dollars in cooperation projects. This shows that the cooperation on the belt and the road is in line with the needs of the well-being of the people of different countries, and this is irreversible.
As President Xi Jinping once said, the construction of the Belt and Road Initiative is in line with the historical trend of economic globalization, the needs of the era of global governance reform and the aspirations of the people of the country. In order to create a more prosperous society, the people of different countries are creating a better life by working together.
