(Phnom Penh): The 6th National Robot Competition 2019 will take place on Saturday, April 27, 2019 from 7:30 am. The ceremony will be held at Dambol Touk Hall, Royal University of Phnom Penh under the chairmanship of Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information.
