Peking University: Samdech Techo Hun Sen is the leader to end the civil war in Cambodia and restore the country's rapid development
(Beijing, China): The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, is the first Cambodian leader to receive the title of "Honorary Professor of International Relations" from Peking University, the largest and oldest university. In Beijing, People's Republic of China.
The handover ceremony on the afternoon of April 25, 2019 at Peking University, on the arrival of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, was warmly welcomed by the leadership of the Ministry of Education of China, the Global Board. The rector of the university, including many Cambodian-Chinese students studying at Peking University.
During the official reception and reception, Samdech Techo PM welcomed the leaders of the Ministry of Education and the Board of Directors of Peking University before handing over the title of Honorary Professor of International Relations to Samdech from Peking University.
At the same time, the leaders of the Ministry of Education and the Board of Directors of Peking University would like to express their happiness to Samdech Techo for answering and accepting the title of Honorary Professor of International Relations from Peking University. The highest honor to the Chinese leadership and people, who have always had good relations with the Prime Minister, as well as the country and the people of Cambodia.
Afterwards, the leaders of Peking University presented the title of International Relations to Samdech Techo PM through the official certificate of the university and the university emblem, considering that from today onwards, Samdech Techo PM Is the official honorary professor of Peking University.
As part of the award, he also praised Hun Sen's actions in supporting China's policy on the belt and road, an initiative of Republican President Xi Jinping. The Chinese people, to this day, many countries around the world have joined in supporting this important initiative.
In that meaningful ceremony, Samdech Techo PM and leaders of the Ministry of Education, the Board of Directors of Peking University opened the mask to symbolize the inauguration of the Royal Research Institute of Cambodia Center of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, sponsored by Peking University. .
