Lumhach Irrigation System in Kampong Chhnang Province with Japanese Aid of About 33 Million USD, More Than 97% Completed
(Kampong Chhnang): Mr. Lim Kean Hor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, on April 25, 2019, accompanied by a working group led by the Ministry and the Director of the Department of Water Resources and Meteorology of Kampong Chhnang Province, inspected the progress of construction work. Lumhach Irrigation System is located in Bariboun District, Kampong Chhnang Province.
According to the report from the director of the department and the project team, the construction of Lumhach irrigation system so far has reached 97.5 percent and is scheduled to be completed in June 2019. According to the plan, when the Lumhach irrigation system is completed, it will be able to irrigate 3,289 hectares of cultivated land in the rainy season and 300 hectares in the dry season.
