(Phnom Penh): The license plate, which is placed according to the wishes of the vehicle owner and can be kept when the car owner sells it, is included in the draft sub-decree on "Registration of vehicle identification and equipment of vehicle license plate". After Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, approves the draft, Cambodians can now apply for a license plate with their own name, company name, loved ones, and so on.
