In the past three months, the Senate has received seven complaints, commissions have met 58 times, conducted nine domestic missions, attended 187 seminars, forums and meetings, and liaised with national and international institutions. 17 times, attended 226 official ceremonies and 289 separate local committee members. According to the same report.
