Drugs kill the future! An animal that smoked drugs and wanted to rape its mother and threatened to kill her was handcuffed and confiscated a gun.
(Central): An elderly woman ran to complain to the police to arrest her son who came from smoking drugs and then returned home, asked his mother to have sex and tried to rape his mother and threatened to kill her. The panicked mother ran to the police, handcuffed the animal, took legal action and confiscated the AK1 rifle, which the suspect hid in the ground.
The above incident happened on April 23, 2019 at the suspect's house in Prey Mean village, Prey Pouch commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province.
Mr. Thach Sovanna, Chief of Criminal Division of Ang Snoul District, said that the victim was a 60-year-old female farmer named Chamroeun Sivun, a farmer in Prey Mean Village, Prey Pouch Commune, Ang Snoul District, Kandal Province. As for the suspect's son, Prak La, 33 years old, Khmer, false occupation, currently Prey Mean village, Prey Pouch commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province, and the evidence of seizing an AK47 weapon was damaged.
Mr. Thach Sovanna said that at the time of the incident, the victim's mother reported to the police that the suspect, a child, was hiding an unknown weapon. Put in a sack buried in the ground in the house.
According to the victim, on April 23, 2019, at 2:00 AM, the suspect, a child, smoked drugs and asked the victim, the mother, to have sex, threatening not to have sex at night. This will kill him and then he was scared and ran to sleep at the house of his son Prak Leang, male, in front of Prey Mean village.
After using drugs, he shouted at his mother to come down from the house at 2 am in order to help look after his child did not threaten to have sex.
