Dr. Sok Touch said: "If history changes according to politicians, then history will become a war, because war arises from the instigation of history, you do not know about Koh Tral, you do not know about "Khmer history is gone, plus those who do not know extremism are starting to explode."
The President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia added, "To this day, some parties owe maps to the Royal Academy of Cambodia, which has misrepresented the map, misleading the people and the youth about their history." "They do not yet fully understand their history."
Dr. Sok Touch continued that the current socio-political process of Cambodia is seen by some historians and politicians as a social, cultural, political and economic conflict continues to burn the Cambodian people. In that, historical events are presented in order to understand the truth, to misunderstand, or to wish for psychological conflict through deception.
Dr. Sok Touch emphasized that the history of ultra-nationalism, the history of negativity, the history of distortion, exaggeration and delusion are all poisons of society, destroying the nation itself.
To prevent all these problems, Mr. Sok Touch called on all historical experts to find the true value of what happened in the past to have a correct understanding.
