(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports this morning, April 22, 2019, cooperated with the National Assembly Committee on Education, Youth, Sports, Cult, Religious Affairs, Culture and Tourism (7th Committee) to organize a workshop on "Education Development". In the digital context in the global and Cambodian framework "under the chairmanship of Dr. Nguon Nhel, First Vice President of the National Assembly.
