The workshop will also focus on key topics such as: 1: Human resource policy in education, 2: opportunities and challenges of education development in Cambodia on the way to the digital age, 3: Implement school management and reform of pedagogical institutes and teacher training institutions; and fourth, the direction towards digital education.
