"Thank you to all the provinces and cities for organizing the New Year with many entertainment programs to provide fun to the people and tourists. This is also an opportunity for young people, grandchildren and great-grandchildren, as well as foreign tourists to learn more about our unique culture and national traditions. "Let the authorities strengthen security and order to ensure safety everywhere during the New Year."
