Authorities and authorities at all levels in Phnom Penh and other provinces to facilitate good traffic order and strengthen security for citizens and tourists on the occasion of the New Year.
I wish my compatriots, nieces and nephews a safe journey to their homeland. Use the free bus for safety and save some money on the occasion of the New Year.
