Another Construction Worker in Sihanoukville Wins 100 Million Riels from Carabao Energy Drink
(Preah Sihanouk): 100 Million Riels of Carabao Energy Drink continued to fall into the hands of a man named Yin Tol, 24 years old, currently working as a construction worker, living at home with his aunt in the courtyard of Wat Prasidhy, Stung Village Chral, O'Bak Rotes Commune, Kampong Seila District, Preah Sihanouk Province.
In front of the team representing the company to hand over 100 million Riel to the accommodation located in the above geographical location, Mr. Yin Tol said that today in terms of family living standards are difficult. Strong enough to leave his hometown in Chhouk district, Kampot province to stay with his aunt to work as a construction worker to earn money to support daily expenses with the family, which does not even have their own house.
He added that especially for winning the big prize from Carabao energy drink company now is also the most coincidental, because from the beginning, he always joked with his family that one day he will be lucky to win 100 prizes. Millions of carabao like before, but now that thought and joke has come true.
He said that last week, after taking a break from work and tired, he bought a can of carabao drink from a vendor in front of the pagoda near the workplace and also near the house to eat.
Suddenly, when I removed the canned earrings, I saw a prize of 100 million riels in the canned earrings.
He immediately shouted to the seller and people nearby to help look and also called the company through the number on the earring. After receiving the grand prize of 100 million riels, he will use some to buy land to build a house and save some to create a business to support family life in the future.
