(Preah Sihanouk): Major General Chuon Narin, Police Commissioner of Preah Sihanouk Province, on April 12, 2019, ordered all police forces to work hard to fulfill their respective duties assigned by their superiors to ensure Safe for the people on the occasion of the upcoming Khmer New Year.
The urging of the Sihanoukville Provincial Commissioner was made on the occasion that Major General Chuon Narin chaired a meeting to review the results of the work in March and disseminate the plan to protect the Khmer New Year, the year of Kor 25, which is approaching. Coming soon. The meeting was held at Sihanoukville Provincial Police.
