Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin stressed that in case of involvement in drug crimes, immediate crackdown must be taken. Massage shops or karaoke bars that embed sexual services must be cracked down on. Illegal gambling, poker, cockfighting, etc. must be cracked down on.
