Mr. Hong Sohour said that this workshop aims to connect experienced entrepreneurs and potential entrepreneurs with those who want to start their own business or those who have just started a business to give them the opportunity to explore new business ideas. Gain experience of running a business project as well as the difficulties of starting a business.
He added that there will also be sharing experiences from speakers, all of whom are founders and senior business leaders, and all participants will have the opportunity to ask questions as well as address questions related to the start-up business. Also.
