The Prime Minister continued that the Royal Government of Cambodia does not have a policy to increase taxes or create new taxes, but what the Royal Government wants is to pay on time in accordance with the law.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen made this remark on the occasion that Samdech Techo had a dinner with the leaders and members of the Khmer-Chinese Association, which was held at the Koh Pich Center in Phnom Penh on the evening of April 9, 2019. This.
