(Phnom Penh): The nationwide campaign against illegal drugs for April 9, 2019 showed that law enforcement forces cracked down on 21 cases, including 2 cases of use and 19 cases of trafficking, arrested 46 suspects .
According to the report, from January 1 to April 9, 2019, law enforcement forces cracked down on 2,187 cases and detained 4,735 people (388 females), including 121 foreigners. Also. Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Over Dinner with Leaders and Members of Khmer-China Association
(Phnom Penh): On the evening of Tuesday, April 9, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, hosted a dinner with leaders and members of the Khmer League Association. - China at the Diamond Island Center.
The banquet to celebrate the arrival of the traditional Khmer New Year is also attended by the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, Mr. Wang Vinthean.
The Khmer-Chinese Coalition Association was established in 1990 by Chinese and Chinese communities in Cambodia and is licensed by the Royal Government of Cambodia. The association is made up of Cambodian-Chinese investors, traders and businessmen who are investing, doing business and doing business in Cambodia.
* On behalf of the Cambodian People's Party and the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked his compatriots who voted for Samdech to continue to lead the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen is proud that his compatriots have faith in the Cambodian People's Party and its leadership
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the election for the Cambodian People's Party is an election to maintain peace and development that continues to this day.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Reminds of Post-Election Chaos Caused by 2013 Losers
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 2018 election is very different from 2013 because we have disbanded the group that caused the chaos
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers that after the 2018 election, the Cambodian economy has continued to grow, which is a confidence for investors
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude and appreciation to the Khmer-Chinese Association for its contribution to solving Cambodia's problems, such as supporting Kantha Bopha Hospital and the Cambodian Red Cross.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants local investors to have more opportunities to do business in the country, even though he wants foreign investment
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, the rich in the country did not use their money to invest in the country, but to invest abroad, bank or buy real estate outside.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's strategic point is to encourage Cambodians to invest more in the country, because in a country where there are problems, those investors die in their own country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he wants all Cambodians to become more and more millionaires
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises the tax-paying culture of investors and the people of Cambodia
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the spirit of Chinese taxpayer culture in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has no policy to increase taxes, but proposed to increase the tax-paying spirit. Samdech Techo continued that this spirit will remain strong for Cambodia to earn money to build the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on Chinese and Cambodian investors of Chinese descent in Cambodia to continue to join the Royal Government in maintaining peace.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that without peace, Cambodia would not be happy and there would be no development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if Cambodia has a war, not to mention development, on the contrary, only to flee the development zone. Samdech Techo asked to look at the countries in the Middle East that are at war, what is the situation of those countries that is not different from the past of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is currently preparing to celebrate the New Year, but Cambodia's past does not have such an opportunity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked Cambodians of Chinese and Chinese descent from Hong Kong, Macau, Taiwan to understand Cambodia's main policy, which has been left behind by Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, by firmly pursuing a one-China policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech could not implement the policy of shaking hands and feet, that is, Samdech allowed Chinese Taiwan to do business in Cambodia, but could not allow Taiwan to have a mission in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen cited as an example that if Cambodia is cut off from any province, Cambodia cannot accept it, so can China. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that respecting China's sovereignty over Taiwan and Tibet is the same as respecting Cambodia's sovereignty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the one-China policy is not new to Cambodia, it dates back to the time of Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, and the current government must continue to maintain and cherish this policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during his visit to China in January 2019, he recently discussed a number of issues with the Prime Minister and President of the People's Republic of China to strengthen Cambodia-China relations and cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that at the end of April, Samdech will attend the second meeting of the Belt and Road Forum in China, and Samdech is scheduled to meet with the Prime Minister and President of China.
* Samdech Techo stated that he expects that Cambodia will attract more Chinese tourists and investors, and China will also buy more Cambodian products.
